michelle: added a compact JS helper in docs (pseudo):```ts
async function retryWithJitter(fn, attempts = 5) {
  for (let i = 0; i < attempts; i++) {
    try {
      return await fn()
    } catch (e) {
      const backoff = Math.min(1000 * 2 ** i, 30000)
      const jitter = backoff * 0.1 * Math.random()
      await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, backoff + jitter))
    }
  }
  throw new Error('max attempts')
}
```

